  "name": "Toe-Bean Tuners",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 10 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.2 lbs.</p>\n<p>These clips are attached to and used to adjust a masterwork instrument such that a creature without the appropriate means can play the modified instrument normally. This includes modifying a woodwind instrument to accommodate a nonstandard mouth. The toe-bean tuners are popular amongst beastial races to adapt instruments to be suitable for use as well as beast tamers and wizards to enable their familiars or pets to learn how to play instruments.</p>\n<p>Examples include modifying a masterwork guitar such that a bestial catfolk without thumbs could regularly strum and work the frets or a masterwork trumpet being able to accommodate a bird’s beak.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/adventuring-gear#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
